WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.202
-Chris and I are about to play
a game called "Slapjack."

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.037
It works the same as blackjack,
but at the end of each round,

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.106
the winner gets to slap
the loser across the face

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.875
with a giant prosthetic hand.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.810
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.481
The first to win three rounds
is the winner.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.283 line:85%
We take turns dealing.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.283
[ Slap! ]

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.852
If it's a tie -- [ Laughs ]

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.587
If it's a tie, the dealer loses.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.722
Chris is our guest.
You're going to deal first.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.458
Two cards each.
Loser gets slapped.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.826
Here we go.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.028
-Up.
-No, up to you.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.464
-It's the second time
I've played blackjack.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:35.869
-Up.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.671
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.539 line:0%
Okay.

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:43.009 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.844 line:0%
Okay.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.412 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.412 --> 00:00:48.815 line:0%
All right. So I -- Hit me.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.450 line:0%
Don't hit me, but hit me, right?

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.919 line:0%
Hit me, baby, one more time.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.354 line:0%
-That's good.
-That's fantastic.

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.021 line:0%
19. I'm going to stay, man.
-Great.

00:00:56.021 --> 00:00:57.991 line:0%
-Yeah. Beat 19.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:00.426 line:0%
Oops.

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:01.794 line:0%
-It's a push!

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:04.097 line:0%
-What does that mean?

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.966 line:0%
-Dealer loses.
-Dealer loses. [ Laughs ]

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.402 line:0%
Dude, you're going to be so
great on "Saturday Night Live."

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.005 line:0%
I'm so psyched.
I can't wait to watch.

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.973 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.341 line:0%
[ Slap! ]

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.676 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.545 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.180 line:0%
I went easy on you.
I went easy on you there.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.149 line:0%
All right. Here we go.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.751 line:0%
-All right. Oh, right.
-Yeah, I got it.

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:27.186 line:0%
-Do you know how to do it?
-No.

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:29.688 line:0%
-No?

00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:31.758 line:0%
-Up.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.960 line:0%
And then...down.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.161 line:0%
-Down.
-Up?

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.462 line:0%
-I don't know. Up.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:39.332 line:0%
-And then...down.
-Down.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:40.867 line:0%
-And then...
-Then...

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.102 line:0%
-...up!

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:46.306 line:0%
12! Loser! [ Laughs ]

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:47.606 line:0%
Wait. Ready?

00:01:47.606 --> 00:01:49.108 line:0%
Come on!

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:51.844 line:0%
Ooh. 16.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.746 line:0%
-Hit me.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.817 line:0%
22!

00:01:57.817 --> 00:01:59.585 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.554 line:0%
-Are we only playing to 2?

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.789 line:0%
[ Slap! ]

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.523 line:0%
-Yeah!

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:06.992 line:0%
Ahh!

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:08.928 line:0%
