00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:21.441 line:0%
-Can you deal?
-No.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:24.110 line:0%
-Aw, man.
-This is very good. Ready?

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.345 line:0%
-Yep. Up.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:28.581 line:0%
-Down. Up.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:29.983 line:0%
And then down.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:31.917 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.917 --> 00:02:33.652 line:0%
We are the worst
